{"id":"a_rea","lemma":"área","pos":"noun","rank":1078,"glosses":["area (a particular geographic region)","are (SI unit of area equal to 100 square metres)","area, field (the extent, scope, or range of an object or concept)"],"ipa":"/ˈaɾea/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"áreas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8f/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-%C3%A1rea.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Conoces bien el área?","en":"Do you know the area well?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/512840","words":[{"g":"to know","l":"conocer"},{"g":"well"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Yo estaba en el área.","en":"I was in the area.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443684","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"No mucha gente vive en esta área.","en":"Not many people live in this area.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/798341","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"much","l":"mucho"},{"g":"people"},{"g":"to applaud","l":"vivar"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"this","l":"este"},null]},{"text":"Abandona esta área ahora mismo.","en":"Leave this area now.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/704175","words":[{"g":"to abandon, to leave","l":"abandonar"},{"g":"this","l":"este"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"right now"]]},{"text":"¿Cuál es tu área de especialización?","en":"What's your area of expertise?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/462113","words":[{"g":"which one, what, which"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"your"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"specialization"}]}]}